## Korean strings for the help text changed by the v0.9.0 release merge
================================================================================

Context:
Merging upstream master (v0.9.0 release, PR #204) into the i18n port added
or reworded three Help modal passages (load-to-General note, FAQ "saved
domain" answer, Knowledge Store bullet). Their text nodes had no Korean
entry, so they stayed in English in the Korean UI.

Changes:

